<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Onobasulu Translation</book>
  <para style="h">Galasia</para>
  <para style="rem">First draft by translators July 2015- Feb 2016</para>
  <para style="rem">March 2017 - Advisor check with Anne, Jack, Yobe, Wabele and Dickson Wadaga.</para>
  <para style="rem">Village check in May/June 2017. VC corrections entered by Antonia Alberts and processed by Anne Stoppels Nov 2017</para>
  <para style="rem">CC with Duncan Kasokason Feb 2022 in Walagu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Folohe Galasia Sesefea Sowi Agele Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galasia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt">Galasia</para>
  <para style="mt2">Folohe Galasia Sesefea</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sowi Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesu kuliba sibaisayone maugalu idele inolomo, Yuda mosomu ilifeadale koleba holobagagalu. Auluso, dufia, Yesuhe Folo e Awalu Sulu Nafulu hele nolobalo idele inolo ilifeada saaba memesi hilibailu. Aufia dufia, ili amoda, Yesune mosomu miliyo suga saabimo, hegelu sulu uleno holobagalu. Saminimo, hele nolobalo idele inolo ili ewehe, Mosesene sulu muguli Yuda ili kuliba abia molologuba, ili amo kuliba abia mololalebiyo. Aga ilida keliso idele inolo adesiamo, ilida Mosesene sulu mugulimo kuliba maiyobafela? Me kuliba maiyobafalela? Yudane sigidubulu inolo noolohe selesia, “Yau inolo ili amoda, Mosesene sulu muguli kuliba abia, ine bado amaleba gelemaba” solu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Auluso, Folo selesia, auba auyaleba solu. E selesia, “Nini Yesu Kelisofea asigi ule ufiyo dobu. Amo alefasiasu, nini Godene si saabiamo, isolu idele inolo moloba ofelesi, nini miliyolu hili dilo. Aulugulu, Mosesene sulu muguli kuliba ano amohe, inolo uleno sagoba ufiyobafale. Aubale koleba.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Eweguba besabe, Yuda inolo noolo hele bule Galasia ami dedalefia, ilihe keliso idele inolo ili ami alebaibu amofea, Mosesene sulu muguli kuliba malalelu. Folohe auba molofeba solu sulu amo dofasia, ehe ine asigi ule ufuludai, ine manadai, saabia isoyone, sowi ewe Galasia ilifea seleba dafogolu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sowi ewe maugaba seleba ofelesiamo, Folohe eweguba solu. Gode Ene alefasia, e-mo hilibaisi daalu dabalu molomesi iminilu. Folo ene hamefeguba kuliba daaluale. Aufia, e inolo ulenone sulu kuliba daaluale. Aubale. Godehe e wefasia, yau idele inolo ilifea Awalu Sulu Nafulu amo samesifia, dabalu efea melu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dufia, Folo selesia, idele inolo Keliso Yesufea asigi ule ofelefe ili amosu, Godene si saabiamo isolu idele inolo adefe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aufia sowi ewene afelesia sulumo, eweguba. Fogo Kelisohe nini sububa dafogofeiya amimo, Asubane Noekenemohe nini luba dibia aasimo, ninihe noolofea mana nafulu mololo.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Na <char style="w">Folo</char>. <char style="w">Hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> nomo, na. Inolo ulenohe na Godene dabalu molomesine iminiluale. Aubale. Na iminilumo, Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisodai</char>, Nao Godedai, aaluhe na Ene dabalu molomesine iminisia hilibailu. Yesu E-da danelu dobia amifia degeba ifolumo, nine Nao Gode amo, E. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Nada, sigidubulu damenedali iwi nadai saabe sunia amoda, ninihe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GAL 1:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 1:2">Sowi ewe, <char style="w">sese</char> Galasia helea ugi waalebu gili amofea seleba mebaisu.<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Nine Nao Godedai, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Kelisodaihe, gilifea kanuluba ofelesia, gine asigine libo esebalo gadaeaba melesi moloyobafe. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:20">Gal 2.20</ref></char></note>Kelisohe, nine Nao Godene hame kuliba abia, E nine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> amo heeba dafiyosia, ene miliyolu weasesia melu. Fogo wolu ninida alebaibia iwifia sububa dafelagomesi auba mololu.<verse eid="GAL 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Nini koleba,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="GAL 1:5">Nao Godene wi digibasu miliyoba.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="GAL 1:5">
    <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">Elalelumo</char>, Efea alefalu alefaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="GAL 1:5">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Amo seale koleba.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awalu Sulu Nafulu no male</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Wae! Gilihe alebale koleba, Gode gilida kanulufia welu amofea golafia, awalu sulu no kuliba dedaleba labe. Amone na hidigiba abulu. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:1">HD 15.1</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:24">24</ref></char></note>Awalu sulu nafulu no male koleba. Aubale. Auluso, inolo noolohe Kelisone Awalu Sulu Nafulumo dedegeyo weiyaasia, gine asigi dabagalaba ofelefe. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:22">1Kld 16.22</ref></char></note>Samini, nini gilifea awalu sulu nafulu walelu. Amone, inolo uleno, nini nagada, me <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">sulu dia ano</char> <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> inigia nagada, Awalu Sulu nini walelu amoguluale walesenaga, inolo amofea kanolo mesia, ninidai melabusia, aisaba dafiyobafe. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Sulu nini ama solumo, aga nahe gilifea saabia bu egeba selesu. Inolo ulenohe, gilifea awalu sulu gili dulu amoguluale walesenaga, inolo amofea kanolo mesia, aisaba dafiyobafe.<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 2:4">1Des 2.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gili eneba hilisese? Na sulu walesiamo, idele inolone asigi sigisia henemesi walefela? Me Godehe henemesi walefela? Nahe aso idele inolo henemesi walesiabiaga, na Kelisone <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu mololo inolo</char> seale koleba alebaiyale.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe Folo welu amone sadalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:17">Mad 16.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne damenedali, gili ewe nafuluba fadaba asigimesi isoba selesu. Yesune Awalu Sulu Nafulu na walelu amo, inolo uleno asigifeafia saabeale. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Na sulu ewemo, inolo ulenofea duluale. Aufia, inolo nooloda nafea walesale. Aubale. Sulu nafulu ewe, Yesu Keliso Ene na labea holobagasia, nafea ulufaba waleso.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">HD 8.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nahe Yudane mana kuliba daaba ligia, samini moloba alolumo, gili dubulu. Mana auba kuliba daaba ligia, na koleba Godene <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo amo elasabiasia, naga meba yaasia, ili woba dafaliyo asigisia, moloba alolu. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">HD 22.3</ref></char></note>Nine nauwadali muguli mana ufulumo, na koleba kuliba daaba alolu. Yudane muguli mana amo asigifia, kuliba daaba ligia, ne sama, na imini alolu noolo, ili amo mololomo, na sunialu alolu. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:1">Ais 49.1</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:7">Gal 2.7</ref></char></note>Auluso, Godehe na kanulusia, daiyalu no ufulu. Na aso nae seba dibale labi, Ehe na Ene dabalu molomesi iminisia gadefalu. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Aufia, Ehe Ene Faibemo nafea ulufaba waleso. Auba molosomo, nahe <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolofea</char> Keliso E amoba awaba memesi auso. Auba molosi, na inolo noolodai neneluale. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Fogo amimo, <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char>, Godehe ilidale iminilumo, Yelusalame ami alebailuso, na ili amoda babiyone fela daaluale. Aubale. Na alebale hamagi, hele Alabia fogoba asulu ami dafasia, dufia Damasegese sidi obegeba mulu.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:26-27">HD 9.26-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, hamu osoloa dafasia labi, na sobele abia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Sifase</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sifaseba selefemo, Fidane wi no selefe. (Yone 1.42 ami bamale.) Sulu <char style="it">sifase</char>mo, Hibulu suluba abane-sia sodo. Sulu <char style="it">fida</char>mo, Giligi suluba abane-sia sodo.</char></note> babiyone, Yelusalame ami fela daafia, na edai sogo alegalu aida alolu. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Na ami ligia, nahe hilibaisi daalu inolo noolo abuluale. Saminilo Yesune elewo <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[3]], Yemese Bugoda selelumo, amo e">Yemese</char>, e-su na abulu. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Sulu ewe nahe gilifea aga selelu ewemo, Godene si saabia sealeba ligia, masegaba selesuale. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:30">HD 9.30</ref></char></note>Na Yelusalame afasia, dufia na Silia heleafia, Silisia helea ami daalu. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Fogo amomo, Kelisone sese idele inolo Yudia ami kakainalu ilihe, ne misi bolale alolubiyo. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Auluso, noolohe na mololumo awasi, ilihe amosu dubulubiyo. Amo ewe. “Samini inolo ogo nini aisaba yaasia, nine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> sunia woba dafaliyo weiyaaba adoso, aga e asigi ule ufulumone Sulu Nafulu waleba labe.” Ili auba awaba mesi, dubulubiyo. <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Aulugulu, Godehe nafea mololuba solu amo dofasia, ilihe Godene wi digiba solubiyo.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Hilibaisi daalu noolo ilida Folodai eesia, hilise ule alolu amone sadalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1-2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.1-2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:2">HD 15.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, hamu daabuluba ulefia biniba (14) alefasia, Godehe na Yelusalame ami malaba walesi, na <char style="w" lemma="Banabasa">Banabasada</char>, ani, ami haiba saabia fela maiyo abia, na <char style="w" lemma="Daidasa">Daidasa</char> eda luba difasia, ninifaba ua daalu. Aufia, Yelusalame ami goafia, na sesene yasilo inolo ilidai gagaiyofia, ninibisu sulu nenelu. Auba nenesiamo, nahe ilifea ne dabalu mololu amone awaba mesia, na <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> ilifea Awalu Sulu Nafulu walelu amone saaba melu. Na ilifea auba fadaba solumone maumo, ne dabalu na aga molosu eweda, samini mololumoda, weaselosisia aulu.<verse eid="GAL 2:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Daidasa nadai alolumo, e Giligi inologulu, ene bado amaleba geleluale alolubiyo. Auluso, Yelusalame sese yasilo ilihe, e bado amaleba gelemabada egedidiba selesale. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:7">Gal 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 5:1">5.1</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 5:13">13</ref></char></note>Seale, fogo ami, inolo noolo bado amaleba geleyale mana amone eeluale, ili ami labeo. Auluso, ili masegane sigidubulu elewodali alebaibiyo. Ilihe nini gagaiyofia nenefe amo dedaboloba labeofia, huga inigia, Keliso Yesu alefasia, sububa dafelagolu mana amone bobonaba babiyone saabeo. Ili amohe, ninifea muguli mana haiba sisa melasia, amone balu dabalu haiba saabia molomaleyo weiyaaso. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Auluso, ninihe ine sulu sisa adesiale, ilifea fogo wedinoda meluale. Nini ilifea fogo mesiabiaga, Kelisone awalu sulu nafulu no haiba dedegebaiyo. Auba molomesi nini hameluale. Aulugulu, Awalu Sulu Nafulu seale amo gilifea ufia melesifia, ilifea fogo wedinoda meluale.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.6-9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 22:21">HD 22.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Yemese 3,">Yemeseda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yoneda</char>, ili Yelusalame sesene guni inolo ligia, wida inolo labe. Gode E-mo, inolo wida labemofea osolaba bolalegulu, nada, ili amo wida dulu labebubamo momoleba asigilale. Auluso, gilihe wi amofea eleda-buba asigiyo hilisesenaga, amo na gilifea eweguba selesu. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Inolo wida amo ilida, ilihe ne sulu amofea gegoaba sulu ulenoda selesale. Aubale koleba. Ili bisigiamo, Godehe Fidamo, Yuda mosomu <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelelo</char> ili amofea, awalu sulu walemesi iminifia, gadefalu. Aubamo, Ehe na-mo, bado gelelale yau mosomu ilifeamo, Yesune Awalu Sulu Nafulu amo walemesi iminifia, gadefalububamo, ili auba asigiso. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Fida e-mo, Yuda idele inolo aleba ami dabalu molomesi, Godehe e sagoba ufulu aubamo, yau idele inolo aleba ami dabalu molomesimo, Godehe nada sagoba ufuluba asigiso. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" /><char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[3]], Yemese Bugoda selelumo, amo e">Yemeseda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Sifaseda</char>, Yoneda, idele inolo noolohe, ili amo sesene ikaugulu labi bolo. Inolo osoloa amo, ilihe Gode nafea kanulusia, dabalu amo nafea melububa baafia, nadai, Banabasadai, eesia, anifea wakaliso. Aufia, nini suniahe hilise ule adesia, sulu ule ofelesia, selesia, animo, yau idele inolo noolo aleba ami dabalu moloyoba solu. Aufia, inemo, Yuda idele inolo ine aleba ami dabalu moloyoba solu. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:29-30">HD 11.29-30</ref></char></note>Sulu auba eeba yaafasia, ilihe anifea kegele uleno gegoaba molomesi doba besabeo. Amo ewe. Yudane sese idele inolo weagulu kakainabumo sagoba homesi doba besabeo. Doba abulu amonemo, sulu na samini moloyo asigifia alolu amone, na aso kiwigaaba molosu.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Fidafea ene olegia ulufaba saaba melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Aufia dufia, fogo na Adiogo sidi labi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Sifase</char> eda ami goaso. E ami labi, nahe efea ene olegia ulufaba gadiba saaba melu. Maumo, e mana heleba mololune aulu. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:3">HD 11.3</ref></char></note>Maugaba, Fida e <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau sigidubulu mosomudai</char> naiyo ua naba ado. Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[3]], Yemese Bugoda selelumo, amo e">Yemese</char> ene damenedali noolo ami goasi, Fida e ili baaba sagiliba adesia, ua ado mana amo afeleso. Maumo, Yemesene damenedali ilimo ewe, <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba geleyone</char> kiwigaaba adone mosomufia mulu. Ilihe Yuda inolo suniafea egedidiba selesia, “Gili koleba, yau inolo bado amaleba geleluale amo ilidai ua naiyo namenabiyoba” sodo. Aulune, Fida ili baaba sagilisia, yau mosomudai haiba no sesamaba adesiale hago labeo. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" /><char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo noolo Fida kuliba abia, ilida Yemesene damenedalifea yau mosomudai sesamaba adalegulu meseneso. Ine mesenelugulu mololo mana amohe, <char style="w">Banabasa</char> eda heleba malesi luba dibia aaso. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Auluso, nahe ili auba meseneba moloba alolu baafia, ilihe Awalu Sulu Nafulu amone seale sodo auba kuliba abiale, heleba aafemone bisigia, nahe Sifasefea, ili suniane olegia eweguba saaba melu. “<char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomu ulenomo ga-so, gene ga yau mosomu mana kuliba abia, Yuda mosomu molologuba adale. Aulugulu, gahe yau mosomu inolo ili ogofea, Yudane muguli mana amo kuliba malabamo, enesi ilifea auba egedidiba selese?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesufea asigi ule ofelefe mana amosu alefasia, idele inolo amo isolu adefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Seale, nini <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo seba dulu amo, nini Yuda mosomu ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomufea</char> alefasia holobagabuale. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:10-11">HD 15.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:20-28">Lom 3.20-28</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:11">Gal 3.11</ref></char></note>Auluso, nini asigibu, Yudane <char style="w">muguli</char> kuliba ano alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai isoba melesi moloba ofolo">inolo Godene si saabia isolu</char> adale. Aubale. Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisofea</char> <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelefe</char> amo alefasiasu, Godehe inolo isoluba sodo. Ninida Keliso Yesufea asigi ule ufulu. Mau enebamo, nini asigisia, eno amo alefasiasu, Godehe nini isoluba sodo. Mau enebamo, muguli kuliba abia, mana nafulu molofe amo alefasia, inolo uleno Godene si saabia isolu holobagaeyobafale.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Aga nini Yudahe, Godene si saabiamo isolu miliyone, Kelisofea asigi ule ofelefe eno amo abiamo, nini nine meleba eloba bisigiamo, nini Yudada, yau mosomu hamagulu, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> mololo lolu. Ausi, inolo uleno eweguba saeyobafebile? Keliso Ehe nini wolu molomesi eelola? Auba aulale koleba. Ninihe auba saeyobale. <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Seale, na wolu inolo loluba eloba abulu. Auluso, na haiba obegeba, nene meleba muguli mana sisa ofelesiabiaga, amo na sagoba ofaiyale. Mana amohe aso walesia, na muguli sulu gelelo inolo loluba walebaiyo.<verse eid="GAL 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Auluso, aga na muguli sulu amo alefasia olalugulu, muguli suluhe na saabia no yasilale. Aubale. Gode na yasimesi bebea lolu. Na Kelisodai imolane baaba dofafasia, edai olalu. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:4">Gal 1.4</ref></char></note> Ausihe, na miliyolu hagaea dulu. Auluso, miliyolu ewemo, ne-ale. Aubale. Keliso E-mo ne miliyolufea labe. Aufia dabaluda, mana na helefealu iwi molosu eweda, Godene Faibefea asigi ule ufulu amo alefasia, molosu. E na bule koleba hamesefia, na sagoba ofelesia, Ene meleba weaselu. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Nahe Godene <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char> eleda malesia, aniba diba ufiyobale. Aubale. Mosesene sulu muguli amohe, nini Godene si saabiamo isolu holobagamesi moloba ofelesiabiaga, amo Keliso olalumo eleda maleba ofaiyo.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Muguli sulu kuliba maiyo mana amo alefasia, gili sagoba ufiyobafale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Wae, Galasia mosomu, gili asigida male adefebu. Ninihe Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisomo</char> gilifea ulufaba walelu. Gine sihe, E <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ufia labi bologuba abulu. Aga abehe gili gonesi, gine asigi dabagalalu? <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Na gilifea kegele uleno doba babiyo hamefe. Gilihe <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> amo dulu ogo, sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> kuliba aafe amofea alefasia, E dulula, me Awalu Sulu Nafulu solu dofasia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelefe</char> amofea alefasia, E dulula? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Gili asigida male adefe koleba! Gili maugasiamo, Asubane Noekenene kiwigagalu amofea alefasia, gili sigidubuluso, aga gilihe gine kiwigagalu amo koleba alefasia, isoba moloba samodoyobafeba hilisefela? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Awalu Sulu Nafulu samini gili kuliba daaba labi, kegele gilifea holobagalumo, balu holobagalu dagulo? Nafuluba, amo balu holobagasoba asigilosi. <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Gode alefasia, Asubane Noekenemo gilifea mesia, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> gili aleba mololu. Ehe gili Yudane sulu muguli kuliba aafe baafia, auba mololula? Me gilihe Kelisone sulu dofasia, Efea asigi ule ofelefe baafia, E auba mololula?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:6">Stt 15.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">“<char style="w">Abalahama</char> e Godefea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesi</char>, Ehe e isolu inoloba solu.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Aulugulu, gilihe sulu ewe nafuluba asigima. Idele inolo abehe, Godefea asigi ule ofelefe ili amo, Abalahamane faibe koleba adefe. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Stt 12.3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:18">18.18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:18">22.18</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:3">Lom 4.3</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 4:16">16</ref></char></note>Ausi, asigi ule ofelefe eno amo alefasia, Godehe yau mosomu ilida <char style="w" lemma="Godedai isoba melesi moloba ofolo">isolu inoloba selefe</char>. Samini waagifia auba moloyobafeba asigifia ligia, Godehe Abalahamafea saaba ofelesia, <char style="qt">“Gafea alefasia, Nahe helefealu mosomu sunia ediliba waaleyobasu”.</char> Godene bugo auba selelu dobu. <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Aulugulu, Abalahama e asigi ule ofelesi, Godehe e <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba ufulu</char>. Aubamo, idele inolo abehe, Godefea asigi ule ofelefe, ili amoda Godehe ediliba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:26">Lo 27.26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, idele inolo abehe, Godene si saabia isolu miliyone, muguli mana kuliba maiyoba hilisefe, ili amo kanoloda dobia ami alebaibu. Enebamo, Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">“Inolo sunia abehe, muguli sulu sunia bugo ami selelu dobumo, kuliba abia molobasu adefale amo, kanoloda dobia ami miliyobafe.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab 2.4</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal 2.16</ref></char></note>Sulu muguli kuliba aafe mana amo alefasia, inolo uleno e Godene si saabia isolu inolo miliyodoluale koleba. Aubale. Asigi ule ofelefe amosu alefasia, Godehe ga inolo isoluba saeyobafe. Godene Bugo auba fadaba selelu dobu. Doma. <char style="qt">“Asigi ule ufulu eno amo alefasia, isolu inolomo e bebea miliyobafe.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Wkp 18.5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:3">Lom 8.3</ref></char></note>Muguli kuliba abia, mana nafulu molofe amo, asigi ule ufiyone kegeleale. Aubale. Amo inolo ene kiwigagalu alefasia mololo kegele. Godene Bugohe eweguba selefe. <char style="qt">“Inolohe muguli sulu kuliba abia, moloba samodofe amo e bebea miliyobafe.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:3">Lom 8.3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 21:23">Lo 21.23</ref></char></note>Auluso, auba moloyodolu inolo uleno male koleba. Aulugulu, muguli amo alefasia, ninifea kanoloda dobia ami melesi gadefalo. Auluso, Keliso E inigia, nini sagoba ofelesia, kanolo amone elegeba diyosia, E imolane baaba dofasia, Ene E kanolo dilo alolu. Maumo, Godene Bugo eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">“Inolo i baaba dofafia labe amo, kanolo dife.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Aulune, Keliso Yesuhe kanolo elegeba dulumo alefasia, yau mosomu ilida Abalahamane <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">edililo</char> diyobafe. Aufia, nini Kelisofea asigi ule ofelesia, Asubane, diyoba oloba huliale saaba ufulu amo, diyobafe.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oloba huliale sulu amohe muguli sulu wasolu koleba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Ne damenedali, agamo nahe gilifea inolo moloba ado amone dedeba walesu. Dabalu, inolo ulenohe moloyoba oloba huliale saaba ofelesia, eelumo, inolo nohe amo afelesia, diba dafiyobafale. Aufia, gegoaba ofada, moloyobafale. Aubale. Dabalu amo, seale solu hamaguba moloyobafe. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Stt 12.7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13.15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 24:7">24.7</ref></char></note>Amogubasu, <char style="w" lemma="Oloba huliale dabalu">oloba huliale sulu</char> Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamafeada</char>, ene sebefeada, saaba ufulu amo, hamagulu dobu. Godene Bugo ami eweguba seleluale dobiyo. <char style="it">“Ene sebedalifeada”</char> auba soluale. Aubale. Eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="it">“<char style="qt">Ene sebefeada</char>”</char> auba selelu dobu. Maumo, sulu ewe Abalahamane faibe ele ule amofeasu iminife. Faibe ele ule amo, Keliso E.<verse eid="GAL 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:40">Kis 12.40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne sulu ewene kiwimo, ewe. Maugabamo, Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Oloba huliale dabalu">oloba huliale dabalumo</char> Abalahamadai molosia eelu. Auba eeba saaba ufuluiya amifia, hamu 430-falu samodofia labi, <char style="w">muguli</char> sulu holobagalu. Muguli sulu dufia koleba holobagalu amohe, dabalu samini molosia eelu amo afelesia, alibialuale. Aufia, amohe oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulu amoda diba dafiyodoluale alolu. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:14">Lom 4.14</ref></char></note>Muguli sulu amofea alefasia, daalo diyosiabiaga, amo oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulumo afaiyo. Auluso, Godehe kanulusia, oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulu amo alefasia, Abalahamafea ediliba ufulu.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 5:20">Lom 5.20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:38">HD 7.38</ref></char>
    </note>Auba aulunaga, amo Godehe sulu muguli enesi ufulu? Godehe idele inolo heleba dedaleba yaafe amo bisigia, muguli sulu gegoaba ufulu. Ausi, muguli sulu amo ufiasu ligia, sebe Gode oloba huliale saaba ufulu amo holobagasi, elolu. Muguli sulu ufulu amo, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> alefasia, olea ado inolofeafia idele inolofea meba ufulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Olea ado inolo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, Mosese selesia aulu.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Olea ado inolo e-mo, mosomu aida adefe amone sagoba ofolomo e. Auluso, Godehe Abalahamafea oloba huliale sulu selesiamo, E elebi alolu. Aulune, amo walesiamo, oloba huliale sulu amo, olaibo koleba adefe.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muguli sulu amo nini luba ado alolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:2-4">Lom 8.2-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba aulugulu, sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> amodai, Godene oloba huliale sulu amodaimo, gisa adefebile? Aubale koleba. Muguli sulu ulenohe miliyolu meyodolu ufulubiaga, muguli amofea alefasia, Godehe idele inolo isoluba sabaiyo. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Auluso, Godene sulu selelu amohe ninifea eweguba solu. Helefealu idele inolo suniamo, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> mana amone sisa ligia, yalaba galifia alebaibu. Aulune, Godene oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulu diyone, eno ule kolebamo, Yesu Kelisofea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufiyo</char> dobu.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 4:3">Gal 4.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Samini, Kelisofea asigi ule ufiyo mana amo, aso ulufaba holobagabale labimo, sulu muguli amohe, ninimo yasifia uluba alolu. Auba ninimo yalaba galifiasu labi, asigi ule ufiyone mana holobagasi, elolu. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:4">Lom 10.4</ref></char></note> Sulu mugulihe, nini auba fofoba yasifia uluba adabia miliba labeofiasu, fogo Keliso saabi, elolu. Nini Kelisofea asigi ule ufulu alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai isoba melesi moloba ofolo">Godene si saabia isolu holobagamesi</char> aulu. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Agamo, asigi ule ufiyo mana amo mulugulu, sulu muguli amohe, haiba saabia no, nini uluba ligia yasiyone dabalu male dobu.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asigi ule ufulu amohe nini Godene faibili holobagamesi moloba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:12">Yon 1.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gili sunia Keliso Yesufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule waalelugulu</char>, amohe gili Godene faibili koleba alebaife. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:3">Lom 6.3</ref></char></note>Kelisofea <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gelu</char> gilimo, gili fagulo saligaloguba, Kelisofea kulifia alebaibu. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:12">Lom 10.12</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, Keliso Yesufea alebaibu gili suniamo, uluse koleba labe. <char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomuda, yau mosomuda, gili imini ule aiba labe. Wida inoloda, widale inoloda, gili imini ule aiba labe. Idoda, inoloda, gili imini ule aiba labe. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:13">Lom 4.13</ref></char></note>Gili Keliso Ene koleba alebaisiamo, amo gilida <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> sebe koleba alebaibugulu, samini Godehe oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulumo alefasia, gilifea Ene daalo diaba yaamesi gadefaeyobafe.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="s">Keliso dabalu mololumo alefasia, nini aga Godene faibili adefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Na besi sulu selesiamo, gilifea sulu iminiba nafuluba fadaba saeyobasu. Faibe olaibo ulenone enao olasimo, enaone heleda, daaloda, e diyobafe. Auluso, faibe amo, ene enao olafia labimo, aso faibe wedino ligiamo, e seale heleda biso labeso, e aso <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu mololo</char> widale hamagulu labe. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Enaohe hilia iminilu amo aso holobagabale labimo, faibe amo, eda yasifia luba ado amone sisa miliyobafe. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:20">Kol 2.20</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, ninida amogulu alolu. Saminimo, nini faibe amogulu widale ligiamo, helefealu iwi muguline elo ufulu sisa ligia, ine dabalu balu moloba ofolo alolu. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4-5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14">Yon 1.14</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:3">Lom 1.3</ref></char></note>Auluso, fogo iminilu holobagasimo, Godehe Ene faibe hilibailu. E idohe seba difasia, Eda Yudane sulu <char style="w" lemma="Muguli">muguline</char> elo ufulu amone usu sugafia alolumo, muguline elo ufulu usu alebaibu ili amone elegefia obegeba diyone aulu. Ausihe, nini Godene fofoba dulu faibili koleba melesine gadefalu.<verse eid="GAL 4:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:15-17">Lom 8.15-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Agamo nini Gode ene faibili alebaibuba walesiamo, Godehe Ene Faibene Asubanemo nine libo usu melesi hilibailu. Asubane amo nine libo usu sigiamo, Godefeamo “<char style="sls">Aba</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aba</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, Hibulu sulubamo “naoba” selefe.</char></note>, Nao-oooba” weba labe. <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Auba aulugulu, aga ga saabia no widale inolo ligiale, Godene faibe koleba labe. Ga Ene faibe ligia, gada Ene daalo diyo amone labe.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Galasia idele inolo amone keleba hiliselu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Samini, gili Godeda asigibale ligiamo, asubane gode sealeale ado amone kiwigagalu sisa ligia, ine balu dabalu mololo alolu. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Auluso, aga gilimo Gode fadaba bisigia asigife. Amosualeso, eweda seale koleba. Gode Ene Ehe, gilida fadaba bisigia asigife. Amo eleda koleba. Gode gili auba asigifia labimo, gili muguli inoloda galiba ine hogobelelu manafealo obegeba kuliba dedalese ogomo, enesi ause? Ili weagulu alebaibubasi, gili seale haiba widale ligia, ine dabalu balu moloyo hamefela? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:5">Lom 14.5</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:16">Kol 2.16</ref></char></note>Aga gili kuliba dedalefemo ewebu. Gili nafulu misiyosia, Yudane gulugululo manane hilia bule noolo adesida, aube hili walesida, gi noolo holobagasida, hamu hili holobagasida, gili ine dabalu molobasu adefebiyo. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Nahe gine mana amone dobelesia, dabalu na gili aleba mololumo weasefebusia, na sagilife.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Ne damenedali, na giligulu alolune, gilida na-gulu melesi, na gilifea susiba selesu. Na gilidai alolu fogo amimo, gilihe nafea wolu uleno molosale. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Gili ewe asigiba obegefia elela? Walefa uleno nafea holobagasi, na hogobelelu ligia, gili labea misiyo mulu. Gili labea ligia, na Awalu Sulu Nafulu gilifea maugaba walelu. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Na walefa ligia, ne domala bedegafia, nafulu alolualene na gilifea dabalu hogololu melu. Auluso, gili na golaba bisigia nafea faiso mesale. Aubale. Gilihe na-mo nafuluba uluba dulu. <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> uleno waagulu, me <char style="w">Keliso</char> Yesu Ene waagulu, uluba diloguba dulu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Fogo amimo, gine asigi nafulu ofelesia, henebasu adeso. Gine henelo amo, aga wagi dobu? Na eweguba ulufaba saaba dafelagosu. Fogo amimo, gilihe na sagoba ufiyo heafusia, nafea kegele suniada mebaiyo. Gili gine si ogo dugufasia, nafea melumohe na sagoba ufulubiaga, gili amoda dugufasia nafea mebaiyo. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Auluso, agamo enefe? Na seale sulu sodo gilifea selesu ewe alefasia, na gilidai gisa adefela?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Nafuluba. Inolo aga gili labea milibailu ogo, gili sigiyone, migagaba molosia alebaibu. Auluso, seale gili sagoba ufiyone aufale. Ine hamemo, ilihe gili ninidai labea amifia sigisia, ilifea sagoba homesine, gilida ilifea migagaba milesi hamefe. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Migagaba aafe ogo woluale. Ga aafea ogo, nafulunaga, amo migagaba aafe mana ogoda nafulu. Na gilidai labinagada, labialenagada, hilia sunia gilihe auba daabasu adesenaga, amo nafulu. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Ne faibili, idelehe faibe hasesia, naga dilo amoguba, nada gili asigisiamo, naga auba diabasu ligia, Keliso ene mimisililu gilifea adesi elosia, naga gadayalo. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Yeele, mana gili aga molofe asigisia, ne asigida daba dafelefe koleba. Aulugulu, na gili labea ugi, gilidai ua miliyo milibaiye. Ausi, misi baaba sulu selesi, nahe ne sulu sodo mana dedegebaiye koleba!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haigadai Seladaine besi sulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Wae, Mosesene <char style="w">muguli</char> kuliba maiyo asigife inolo gili, na hilisesia, gili sulu muguli amo nafuluba fadaba asigibualebuba hilisesu. <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:15">Stt 16.15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21.2</ref></char></note>Maumo, Godene bugo selelu dobu amo selesiamo, <char style="w">Abalahama</char> e inolo faibe aida alolu. Faibe nomo, widale balu dabalu mololo ido Haigahe seba dulu. Faibe nomo, beega aselo ido Selahe seba dulu. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7-9">Lom 9.7-9</ref></char></note>Balu dabalu mololo ido amohe, faibe seba dulu amomo, idodai inolodai molosi, seba dilo amoguba, helefealune huu alefasia seba dulu. Auluso, beega ido amohe, faibe seba dulumo, Gode ene oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulu amone ililiba ofelesia, seba dulu.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Ido aidane sadalu amofea besi sulu selesumo ewe. Ido aida amomo, <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> aida moloyone besiba solu amofea iminife. Dabalu nomo, <char style="w">Sainai</char> galea amifia mololune, balu dabalu mololomone faibe seba dilo. Amomo, <char style="w">Haiga</char>. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Balu dabalu mololo ido Haigane besi sulu amone kiwi, ewe. Haiga e-mo, Sainai gale amone iminife. Sainai galea, Alabia helea amimo, Isolaele mosomuhe ine muguli sulu ami dulu. Aufia, Haiga Yelusalame sidi helefealu iwi labe amoda iminife. Maumo, Yelusalameda, ene faibilida, muguli elo usu ligia, balu dabalu mololo widale alebaibu. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:22">Hib 12.22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:2">MUU 21.2</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:10">10</ref></char></note>Beega aselo ido Selane besi sulu amone kiwi, ewe. Sela ehe saaba ufulu sulu amone oloba huliale dabalu amone iminife. Ausia, e-mo Ana Lagone Yelusalame iminife. Yelusalame hili amo beega labegulu, e nine nae labe. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Ais 54.1</ref></char></note>Godene bugo amone iminisia selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GAL 4:27" />
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">
    <char style="qt">“Ido saune, faibe seba dilale labe ga, henema.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">
    <char style="qt">Faibe hasesia, naga duluale ga, heafusia koleba wuaama.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">
    <char style="qt">Maumo, ido hafinilu amone faibilihe, ido ainoda amone faibili wasolu miliyobafe.”</char><verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:4-5">Stt 15.4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:7">Lom 9.7</ref></char>
    </note>Ne damenedali, Godehe oloba huliale sulu saaba ofelesia, Aisege seba dulu amogubamo, aga gilida, Godehe oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulu amo alefasia, Ene faibili koleba holobagafia alebaibu.<verse eid="GAL 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.29-30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 21:9-10">Stt 21.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:35">Yon 8.35</ref></char>
    </note>Helefealune huu alefasia, domalane seba dulu amohe, Asubanene seba dulu amofea gisa alolu. Amogubasu aga iwida auba molofe. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Auluso, Godene bugohe eneba selefe? E selesia, <char style="qt">“Widale balu dabalu mololo idoda, ene faibeda, asigaba dafalimale. Maumo, widale idone faibe amo daalo uleno diyobafale. Beega ido amone faibehe, enaone daalo osolabale, sunia e-su diyobafe.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Aulugulu, ne damenedali, nini asigibu. Nini widale balu dabalu mololo ido amone faibili loluale. Aubale. Nini beega ido amone faibili lolu.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Keliso alefasia, nini beega melesi sububa dafogolu lolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />
    <char style="w">Keliso</char> alefasia, nini beega melesi, Ehe nini sububa dafogolu. Aulugulu, gili koleba kiwigaaba kalugaafia, nohe sulu muguline alu higinilu gili haiba saabia no agiba homesi fogo memabiyo.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Na <char style="w">Folo</char>, nahe gilifea sulu ewe fadaba saeyobasugulu, gili nafuluba doma. Godehe gili isoluba samesi asigifia, gine bado amaleba gelemasia, nofea fogo mesenaga, gili Kelisone sagoba ofolo diyobafale. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Sulu ewe nahe gilifea ulufaba fadaba saabia selesu. Inolo abehe, bado amaleba gelemesisia ene fogo mefe amo, Yudane sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> sunia nooloda gelebale amone elo usu miliyo dobu.<verse eid="GAL 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Gili abehe, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai isoba melesi moloba ofolo">Gode e isolu inolo labeba</char> bamesine weiyaasia, Yudane sulu muguli amo kuliba daaba elenaga, gili Kelisodai alolumo geleba dafelefe. Gilihe Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> mana amo afolu dobu. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenene</char> kiwi alefasia, nini Godefea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulune</char>, Ehe nini isolu inoloba samesine <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia</char>, asigi gagafia, heneba yasifia lolu. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:19">1Kld 7.19</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:15">Gal 6.15</ref></char></note>Keliso Yesufea kulifia adefe gilimo, <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelesenagada</char>, me gelesalenagada, amo Godene si saabiamo eleda male besabe. Yesufea asigi ule ufiyo amosu, Godene si saabia eleda besabe. Asigi ule ufulu amone sebemo, noolofea hameselo mana moloba walelo.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Gili sulu seale sodo amo kuliba abia, naguba imini iminiba nafuluba dedaleba aloluso, aga abehe gili kaaso? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Gine asigi ogoda seseaba ulubia aafe ogo, Gode gilida welu amo alefasia aufale. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:6">1Kld 5.6</ref></char></note>Asigima. Boledida bulelo <char style="w">yisi</char> wedino, falawa amodai besisenaga, amo boledi sunia bulelo. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:7">Gal 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:15">2Kld 11.15</ref></char></note>Na kiwigaaba hilisesiamo, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> gili sagoba ofelesi, gilihe nadai hilise ule adesia, asigi no ufiyobafale. Abenagada, gine asigi ogo elawaneba ofelefe amo, ene molofe amone elebe wolu diyobafe.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Ne damenedali, na sulu mana walesiamo, na aso inolofea bado amaleba gelemaleba selaba ligiabiaga, amo enesi inolo noolohe aso nadai gisa alebaiyo? Nahe auba waleba ligia, Keliso <char style="w">imolane</char> olaluba walesialebiaga, ine asigihe imolane amofea gadibaiyale. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Gilida elawaneba ofolo inolo amo, ilihe ine domala haisi gelesia, kegele sunia dogoloba yaasiabiaga, amo nafulubaiyo.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 2:16">1Fid 2.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Seale, ne damenedali, Godehe gili beega melesi welu. Auluso, beega loluba hilisefia, gine <char style="w" lemma="Helefealune huu">helefealune huufea</char> fogo melosi. Aubale. Gili auba hilisemabiyo. Auluso, gine geleba hamesesia, sagoba waalemale. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Wkp 19.18</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Lom 13.9</ref></char></note>Sulu muguli sunia ule amofea gagaiyoba ufulu dobu. <char style="qt">“Gahe ge damene noolo hamesesiamo, gene meleba hamesebu amogubasu, nooloda auba hamesemale.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Auluso, gili aleba gine geleba muba gagaba yaasia, faguba naasenaga, amo gili nafuluba. Gili gine geleba nonoba naba samodolosi.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asubane Noekenene miliyolu usu mela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Na selesumo ewe, gili koleba gine miliyolu ogo, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char> luba dibia daaba melesi waagi gadefamale. Aulugulu, gili auba molosenaga, <char style="w">helefealune huu</char> amone molobaiyesia, mesegelo mana kuliba abia moloba dafelagoyobafale. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:15-23">Lom 7.15-23</ref></char></note>Gine asigine libo usuhe, helefealune huu amone hamedai, Asubanene hamedai, gisa adefe. Asubanehe ga ge hame wolu amo moloba dafelagomesi hamefale. Auluso, ge helefealune huu ogohe, ga Asubanene sulu domesi hamefale. Aalu auba gisa adesimo, kegele gili moloyo hamefemo moloyodoluale ado. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Aulugulu, Asubane Noekenehe gili luba dibia aasenaga, amo gili <char style="w">muguli</char> elo usu miliyobafale.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:9-10">1Kld 6.9-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Helefealune huu amone manamo, gili fadaba asigiba samodobu. Mana amo ewe. Susuguda, nugumaluda, libo degeloda, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />masega godefea gulugululoda, goneda, gogololoda, belaguloda, babiyo haboloda, kanoloda, asigumeda, osolaba dedaleloda, asigi aidafia hegeloda, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />aufia mesegeloda, kagoaloda, sigilo hulagaloda, aufia mana nokene nokeneba amogulumoda.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GAL 5:21">Na gilifea ama auba haguguba solugulu, aga na sulu hamagane saabia bu egeba selesu. Idele inolo mana amogulu molosia waalefemo, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamone daalo diyobafale.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Auluso, Asubane Noekene amone sebemo ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GAL 5:22" />
  <para style="li" vid="GAL 5:22">Hameseloda,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GAL 5:22">Heneloda,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GAL 5:22">
    <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">Aealoda</char>,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GAL 5:22">Esebalo adoda,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GAL 5:22">Hamedufuluda,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GAL 5:22">Nafulu heafuba mololoda,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GAL 5:22">Fedoba seloda,<verse eid="GAL 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />Onaba adoda,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GAL 5:23">Aufia, asigi uluba ado amofea elofe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GAL 5:23" />
  <para style="m" vid="GAL 5:23">Mana nafulu ewegulu molomabiyoba, kaaba muguli solu ufulu uleno male koleba.<verse eid="GAL 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 6:6">Lom 6.6</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:5">Kol 3.5</ref></char>
    </note>Keliso Yesune mosomu sunia ilihe, ine helefealune huu amodai, amone molobaiyesia mesegelo amodai, <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ufulugulu, mana amo olalu dobu. Aulune, mana amofea saabia fogo memabiyo. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Asubane Noekene alefasia, ninifea miliyolu melo. Aulugulu, nini koleba Asubane Noekenemohe nini luba dibia daaba melesi waagi gadefamale. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:3">Fil 2.3</ref></char></note>Nini koleba bamabamamabiyo. Aufia, ninihe nine geleba gagadiba molomabiyo. Aufia, ninihe nine geleba, no mana molofemoda, none kegeleda, mesegemabiyo.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Edo gefe hamagulu sebe suiyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mad 18.15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne damenedali, gilihe uleno heleba aasi baaba golesenaga, amo Asubane Noekeneda labe gilihe, e sagoba ofelesia, ene mana onaba isomale. Aufia, gilida gine meleba haguguba ligia molomale. Gilida dedeba besabi, wolu mololosi. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:1">Lom 15.1</ref></char></note>Gili koleba, gine geleba sagoba waalesia, none higinilu agigifia dedalemale. Mana ewe molofe amo alefasia, gili <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> sulu <char style="w" lemma="Muguli">mugulimo</char> ililiyobafe.<verse eid="GAL 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Inolo uleno widale ligia, “Na wida loluba” asigisenaga, amo e ene meleba gegefe. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Nini elebi elebibahe, nine mana nafuluba osolaba bamale. Mana ga mololu ogo, nafulu besenaga, amo ga gene meleba henesia kaiimale. Auluso, mana ga molofe amodai, noolo mana molofe amodai, iminimabiyo. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:12">Lom 14.12</ref></char></note>Maumo, Yesu kuliba abiamo, dabalu ga moloyo dobu amo, gene agiluguba, gene agifia malale. <verse eid="GAL 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:11">1Kld 9.11</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 9:14">14</ref></char></note>Godene sulu mana dobelesia dawalolo dife gilihe, kegele nenafolo gili dobu ogone, kegele noolo difasia, inolo Godene sulu manada walefe ilifea osolafia memale.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:13">Lom 8.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Babeaba asigi heleba malabiyo. Ga koleba gene meleba gegemabiyo. Godemo, ga gegeyodoluale koleba. Gilihe edo amenegulu geiya gelumo, hamagane sebe suiyobafe.<verse eid="GAL 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Aulugulu, inolohe ene <char style="w" lemma="Helefealune huu">helefealune huufea</char> edo gesenaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GAL 6:8">amo e woba dafolone sebe suiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GAL 6:8">Auluso, inolo abehe, Asubanefea edo gesenaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GAL 6:8">amo e Asubanefea alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Miliyolu miliyo">miliyolu miliyone</char> sebe suiyobafe.<verse eid="GAL 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Ninihe mana nafulu moloyomo, bonesia kiwi saneyobale. Enebamo, ninihe dabalu nafulu moloyomo, kiwi sanesalenaga, amo sebe sufeiyamo, ninihe sebe nafulu koleba suiyobafe. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Aulune, fogo adefe hilia ewemo, ninihe idele inolo suniafeamo mana nafulusu moloyoba. Auba molosiamo, nine sigidubulune damene ilifeada, mana nafulusu koleba moloyoba.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Keliso imolane olalu amo bule kegele koleba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Sulu haisi sowi nene sone selelugulu, gilihe sodoloba selelu ewe bisigiamo, na sone selelububa asigimale.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Folohe sowi selelu amo, ene sone koleba selelale. Aubale. E sulu mofeyo selaba labi, inolo none sone alefasia, sulu e selefe amo selelu. Auluso, aga iwimo, Folo ene sone alefasia, sulu noolo selelu. Ausi, sowi eweda alegafe amohe, eweguba eloba bamesine aulu. Sulu sowi ewene usu selelu dobu amo, Folone asigifeafia selelubiyo. Sulu amo, inolo none asigifeafia muluba hiliselosine, ehe ene sone imini auba ufulu.</char></note><verse eid="GAL 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Inolo noolohe, noolone si saabia, wi bule dibaiyeba asigisiamo, gili bado amaleba gelemesisia, egeba saeyo weiyaafe. Enesi ili auba molofe? Mau ewe. Inolo noolohe Kelisone <char style="w">imolane</char> amo habosia, ilifea higinilu melosiba hilisesia, ili sagilisiane aulu. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Inolo auba walefe ili amo, ine bado amaleba geleluso, sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> amo sunia, inemo kuliba anale. Ilimo ine meleba kaiibaiyesia asigifiasu, gilida bado amaleba gelemaba egeba selefe. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul with large handwriting" file="C103.tif" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="6.11">Folo e sulu mofeyo selaba labi, inolo none sone alefasia, sulu e selefe amo seleba ofelefe.</figure><verse eid="GAL 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Auluso, na nene meleba kaiisuale. <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Keliso <char style="w">imolane</char> olalu amonesu, na kaiisu. Yesu imolane dufa olalu amohe, nafea helefealune mana moloyo asigilo amomo, dufa olalu dobu. Aufia, helefealune mana amohe, na haiba saabia no yasifia uluba miliyobafale. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:6">Gal 5.6</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:17">2Kld 5.17</ref></char></note>Agamo, inolo <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelelualenagada</char>, bado gelelunagada, amo eleda male koleba adefe. Auluso, inolo miliyolu hagaeada dife amomo, eleda bule kolebamo amo. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Godehe idele inolo sunia asigi eweda kuliba aafe ili amofeamo, kanuluba ofelesia, esebalo gadaeaba mesesi gadefaeyobafe. Aufia, Ehe Ene <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu amofeada aubasu moloyobafe.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 4:10">2Kld 4.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ne domala ewefea imini waalebu ewe selesiamo, na Yesu Ene dabalu mololo inoloba walesia aufe. Auba aulugulu, inolo noolohe higinilu amo nafea saabia memesialeba asigisu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Ne damenedali, nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisone <char style="w">kanululo</char> mana amo, gine asubane ogodai miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GAL 6:18">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>
    </char>. Seale koleba auba auyobafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 6:18">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="6.18" /><verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>